<title>INDIA: India raises venture capital investment limit.</title>
<headline>India raises venture capital investment limit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Finance Minister P. Chidamabaram said on Friday venture capital firms will be allowed to invest up to 20 percent of their corpus in a single company's equity, against an existing ceiling of five percent.</p>
</text>
